  Y: Equal-length finite second measurements paired by index. List of real.
  ALTERNATIVE: TwoSided (default), Less or Greater for the population mean difference. Symbol (one of two-sided, less, greater); default 'two-sided.
  CONF-LEVEL: Finite confidence level in (0,1), default .95. Real; default 0.94999999999999996.
Returns: One-sample difference result with method Paired t-test; estimate1 is mean difference, CI targets the same difference. <hypothesis-test-result>.
Raises: datamunge-invalid-argument (std::invalid_argument) Length mismatch, nonfinite data/differences, invalid controls or zero/nonfinite difference standard error.
